{
  "title": "Hearty Gooey Slovakian Lentil Stew",
  "description": "A buttery and romantic Slovakian dish featuring sumac, this stew is perfect for a cold winter night, and is plant-based-friendly. It is a comforting and flavorful meal that is sure to become a favorite.",
  "cuisine": "Slovakian",
